{"id": "122817", "revid": "144844", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=122817", "title": "Santo Ant\u00f4nio de Jesus", "text": "Santo Ant\u00f4nio de Jesus is a city of 103,000 people (2022) in Grande Salvador. It is considered the capital of the Rec\u00f4ncavo Baiano, due to its importance as the largest commercial, industrial, educational, health and service center in the entire region.\nGet in.\nIt is 187 km from Salvador\nDo.\nSanto Ant\u00f4nio de Jesus hosts busy June festivities every year, which attract thousands of visitors from all over the country, and which made the city known for hosting the best and most popular S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da\u00a0Bahia."}
