{"id": "123198", "revid": "160739", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=123198", "title": "S\u00e3o Louren\u00e7o do Sul", "text": "S\u00e3o Louren\u00e7o do Sul is in the Southeast of Rio Grande do Sul.\nSee.\nBeaches.\nS\u00e3o Louren\u00e7o do Sul has several freshwater beaches on the Lagoa dos Patos."}
